{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"李家超訪問北京和上海\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CE-BJ-261103-17.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】行政長官李家超訪問北京和上海。</p><p>行政長官李家超下午抵達北京，他將出席周三上午舉行的京港洽談會開幕式，並與北京市官員會面；同日轉往上海，周四出席進博會開幕式，並在虹橋國際經濟論壇致辭，周五返港。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:42:08.967056+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:35:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:38:24.051668+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:38:31.940141+00:00","content_hash":"a2338e00d743c421999abec42cc804fdb8e168f07cbb8465abd0dc65e25daece","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T10:42:08.967056+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}